  "description": "Due to an unexpected accident, Hong Cha-yoon fell from a genius dancer to the caregiver of Whimoon Group's Chairman, Tae Woo-seop, . While staying at a country villa to care for Chairman Wang, she unintentionally becomes entangled with Whimoon Group's head of department, Tae Moo-kyung... Is Cha-yoon just a fleeting fling for this arrogant, yet overwhelming man, who grabs hold of anyone she pushes away, or is she the beginning of love?\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=11346053)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**      \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=837908), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12429822) \n\n**Official Translations:**      \n[Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/the-night-beneath-you/list?title_no=8438)",
